        IF provision's `section` AT LEAST 722 AND provision's `section` AT MOST 722.2 THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the rules provided for in sections 722 to 722.2 apply"

