`s 715.37(4)(c) the prosecutor's deemed duty to provide a copy of the statement` MEANS
    PARTY `the prosecutor`
    MUST `s 715.37(4)(c) make reasonable efforts to provide a copy of the statement to the organization or counsel for the organization`

